As a lizardman dk tank 1kCP+, I use inner fire (ranged taunt), piercing (taunt), chains to pull in the adds, and I also use Eruption which slows down the enemy by 70% and then I use talons to keep them in while still taunting everything. **It's entirely possible and totally doable to pull everything in on you/trash mobs and hold them for the DPS to melt them away (unless the particular add is unmovable/untauntable).**

&amp;#x200B;

Too often when I am not on my tank and happen to que for a random vet, tanks just run into the middle and taunt a few of the adds while all the other adds are running all over the place. **You have abilities to crowd control. USE THEM!** Also there are alot of mobs/even main bosses than can be interrupted by bashing.... **DO IT.**
